### ============================================
### 6. User-Specific Caching - Cart
### ============================================

### Test 6.1: Get User Cart (Cache Miss)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

# Note response time

###

### Test 6.2: Get User Cart (Cache Hit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

# Expected: Much faster (user-specific cache, 1 hour TTL)

###

### Test 6.3: Add Item to Cart (Invalidates User Cache)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "clx123456789",
  "quantity": 2
}

# This should invalidate all caches for this user

###

### Test 6.4: Get Cart After Update (Cache Miss)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

# Should be slower (cache invalidated)

###

### Test 6.5: Cart Item Count (Cached per user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart/count
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

